hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-30 : List (List Word)
hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-30 = cons "Dependency certificates (§10.5, equation 10.13) record exactly what a derivation read: each key and version, and" (cons "each absence at its epoch. A derivation whose certificate is still valid can be reused without recomputing. One" (cons "whose certificate is broken is recomputed, and only those. That's the invalidation rule materialized inference" (cons "never had. A knowledge graph built this way can't hold a stale inference, because staleness is detectable: an" (cons "inference whose certificate fails is known not to be current." (cons "" nil)))))
